 5th edition World of Darkness conversion guide for Changeling: The Dreaming. As always, they were a joy to chat with. I hope folks enjoy our discussion!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://walkingawayfromarcadia.podbean.com/e/5th-edition-conversion-guide-with-charlie/\" target=\"_blank\">https://walkingawayfromarcadia.podbe...-with-charlie/</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I saw! Listened to it on my drive home last night!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25663-rigelj","name":"RigelJ","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-19T10:04:47-08:00","id":1361925,"title":"","content":"Has anyone tried this out yet? I have a group that wants to play it, but I haven't been able to find a character sheet anywhere. Anybody have one? If not we'll make one and share it here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25151-mayhawk","name":"Mayhawk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-19T14:24:07-08:00","id":1361984,"title":"","content":"I was thinking maybe C5 should also have Glamour resonance and musing types (to replace blood resonance and predator types), I didn't see anything like that mentioned in the PDF. Anyone else have any thoughts on that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25151,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25151-mayhawk","user":"Mayhawk","date":". 01-19-2020, 07:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25151-mayhawk","name":"Mayhawk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-19T17:02:42-08:00","id":1362023,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mayhawk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1340810-c5-ruminations?p=1361984#post1361984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was thinking maybe C5 should also have Glamour resonance and musing types (to replace blood resonance and predator types), I didn't see anything like that mentioned in the PDF. Anyone else have any thoughts on that?</div> </div> </div> </div>Same here. I couldn't devote the time to that much word count though.<br /> <br /> If you run the game, please post about how it goes! I'd love to hear about it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-20T06:37:21-08:00","id":1362094,"title":"","content":"Another change that I\u2019ll like it\u2019s kind of Minor but. I\u2019ed like it if the Hawaiians Changling backstory gets changed from a white savior Changling taught them the Changling Way and know they worship a Nocker,<br /> <br /> And have them have their own ritual inspired by Polynesian mysticism..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-20T11:45:49-08:00","id":1362179,"title":"","content":"I thought the Changling Way merged the two souls?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-20T13:53:15-08:00","id":1362214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1340810-c5-ruminations?p=1362179#post1362179\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I thought the Changling Way merged the two souls?</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you referring to the Tithed? If so, you are correct. But, there was at least the first time a fae took a mortal body before they could undergo the changeling way and start the cycle of reincarnation. Much like the sidhe returning from Arcadia, that first time was hurried and displaced the mortal's soul instead of merging with it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-20T13:54:02-08:00","id":1362215,"title":"","content":"Oh god. What happened to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-23T06:21:35-08:00","id":1362867,"title":"","content":"The folks at The Story Told podcast interviewed me about the conversion guide recently. I hope folks enjoy listening to us discuss it as much as I did talking to them about it!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/c5-conversion-with-charlie-cantrell\" target=\"_blank\">http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/c5-co...arlie-cantrell</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","user":"PookaKnight","date":". 01-23-2020, 09:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-24T12:52:07-08:00","id":1363168,"title":"","content":"Cool, I never found the Kith number to be too big. But I understand . The Hsein seem to have nothing to do with Changlings at all. They are totally separate entities that have no connection to the dreaming. Because Asian people don\u2019t dream?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T02:27:14-08:00","id":1368260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1340810-c5-ruminations?p=1362867#post1362867\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The folks at The Story Told podcast interviewed me about the conversion guide recently. I hope folks enjoy listening to us discuss it as much as I did talking to them about it!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/c5-conversion-with-charlie-cantrell\" target=\"_blank\">http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/c5-co...arlie-cantrell</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, so, I hadn't looked at this, and now I have and listened to the podcast, and I think to you've made my favourite version of CTD and I'm very happy.<br /> <br /> In a way, it's almost funny to see the game come around to what it could have been back in the early 00's (<br /> <br /> Also great work on the looks. One thing I would change (because I don't think V5's choices are bad per se, just maybe poorly edited), is to use two columns instead of three.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25136-kev\u00e4\u00e4n-neito","name":"Kev\u00e4\u00e4n Neito","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25136_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T02:40:42-08:00","id":1368264,"title":"","content":"It would make for an interesting thought exercise, but I do think any C5 is a long way off before anybody gets ahead of themselves. <br /> <br /> For me, C20 was actually the best of the Anniversary editions largely because it managed to expand on the game, internationally, along with a more rounded out set of options for characters. If there was a new edition, I would like to address the over-arching issue with every Changeling edition - being that it\u2019s tone is just very incongruous with the rest of the WoD games. Personally, I\u2019d like to play up the horror aspects of being an \u2018alien being' in the mundane world a bit more - and I\u2019d also like to see the people the Changelings have cuckoo\u2019d be made into antagonists - as a sort of dark reflection of the characters trapped in the faerie realm. Or something like that. <br /> <br /> Mechanically, I\u2019d really like to see the Glamour/Magic system being emphasized a bit more too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T06:18:46-08:00","id":1368292,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trippy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1340810-c5-ruminations?p=1368264#post1368264\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would make for an interesting thought exercise, but I do think any C5 is a long way off before anybody gets ahead of themselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am only betting in WTA because it was confirmed and it makes me curious to skim through a playable version of that.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25136-kev\u00e4\u00e4n-neito","name":"Kev\u00e4\u00e4n Neito","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25136_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T14:08:01-08:00","id":1368391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trippy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1340810-c5-ruminations?p=1368264#post1368264\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would make for an interesting thought exercise, but I do think any C5 is a long way off before anybody gets ahead of themselves. <br /> <br /> For me, C20 was actually the best of the Anniversary editions largely because it managed to expand on the game, internationally, along with a more rounded out set of options for characters. If there was a new edition, I would like to address the over-arching issue with every Changeling edition - being that it\u2019s tone is just very incongruous with the rest of the WoD games. Personally, I\u2019d like to play up the horror aspects of being an \u2018alien being' in the mundane world a bit more - and I\u2019d also like to see the people the Changelings have cuckoo\u2019d be made into antagonists - as a sort of dark reflection of the characters trapped in the faerie realm. Or something like that. <br /> <br /> Mechanically, I\u2019d really like to see the Glamour/Magic system being emphasized a bit more too.</div> </div> </div> </div>i like the change of tone Changeling is Tragic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T03:15:34-08:00","id":1368501,"title":"","content":"CTD always seemed super dark to me. In a different way from the others. But the others are already different from each other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25136-kev\u00e4\u00e4n-neito","name":"Kev\u00e4\u00e4n Neito","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25136_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}